        "page": 3,
        "section": "body",
        "sentence_id": "p3_s7"
      },
      "text": "Within a two-week window, \" John Kasai \" also registered the following domains: airtravelabroad.com, beijingnewsblog.net, grouptumbler.com, leveldelta.com, nasdaqblog.net, natureinhome.com, nestedmail.com, nostressjob.com, nytunion.com, oilnewsblog.com, sixsquare.net and ustradecomp.com .",
